{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/648515-learning-fused-arcanos","id":648515,"title":"Learning fused Arcanos?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Wraith: The Oblivion"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-01T19:49:21-07:00","id":648515,"title":"Learning fused Arcanos?","content":"What are the barriers to learning fused Arcanos? I see a few that interests me, but supposedly only Ferrymen can learn them. What prevent Doomslayer organizations and the Legions and Guilds from figuring them out?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-02T00:16:51-07:00","id":648614,"title":"","content":"There're at least two different ways to merge Arcanoi in the books.<br /> <br /> The first, tempered Arcanoi, is in Wraith: the Great War. Tempering Arcanoi requires knowing one of the Arcanoi in question at level 5, and purchasing the other Arcanos up to the level required with XP, even if you already know it (meaning, basically, you're better off starting from a place of ignorance). It takes several months about equal to the Arcanoi's combined rating to develop, requiring between 1-4 Pathos a day, and three rolls that must gain successes equal to the Arcanoi's combined rating, on which Willpower cannot be invested. (Or put simply: tempered Arcanoi require mastery of at least one Arcanos, several months' free time, and a lot of Pathos.)<br /> <br /> The other, the one you're referring to, are alloyed arts, in Ends of Empire. They use the same XP chart as alternate arts (Wraith 2e, p. 133), paying the cost of an art rated one higher than the highest-rated Arcanos used in the alloy. Both Arcanoi in the alloy need to be known at appropriate levels beforehand. EoE says that to date only Ferrymen know them, but there's nothing stopping an outsider learning them or discovering them on their own.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-02T20:02:01-07:00","id":649640,"title":"","content":"Is there any functional difference between the two merged Arts? One more powerful than the other.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-02T23:29:56-07:00","id":649790,"title":"","content":"There is one, best I can tell - tempered Arcanoi require one Arcanos be rated 5, while alloyed arts don't.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}